stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> shadow: register(card)
    shadow --> canary: promote() + gates pass
    canary --> production: promote() + gates pass
    shadow --> shadow: promote() + gate failure
    canary --> canary: promote() + gate failure
    shadow --> rolled_back: rollback(reason)
    canary --> rolled_back: rollback(reason)
    production --> rolled_back: rollback(reason)
    rolled_back --> [*]

    note right of shadow
        Gates: min_ndcg, min_delta,
        max_p_value, max_generalization_gap
    end note

    note right of production
        Terminal for promotion.
        Rollback remains available.
    end note
